{
  "summary": "Nick Xenophon Team senator Skye Kakoschke-Moore said she would resign after learning she holds British citizenship by descent through her mother, making her ineligible for the Senate. She said the discovery was shocking because she had previously been told she was not eligible for British citizenship. Kakoschke-Moore plans to ask the High Court to decide how her seat should be filled and said she still hopes to return to politics. A 2016 Senate vote review could result in NXT figure Tim Storrer taking the seat, though Nick Xenophon said legal advice suggested the outcome may be uncertain."
}

